WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.230
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:08.500 --> 00:12.220
[Mount Zhaowu]

3
00:15.260 --> 00:16.780
[Equal to Heaven and Earth]

4
00:16.780 --> 00:18.840
Madam Wei, since you took over Mount Leiguan,

5
00:19.120 --> 00:19.940
we of Mount Zhaowu

6
00:20.230 --> 00:21.850
have yet to visit and pay our respects.

7
00:22.280 --> 00:23.170
Please forgive

8
00:23.190 --> 00:24.900
our lapse in courtesy.

9
00:25.380 --> 00:29.220
[Wei Zhixi, New Leader of Mount Leiguan]

10
00:29.510 --> 00:30.810
My master is unwell

11
00:31.390 --> 00:32.450
and must meditate to recover.

12
00:32.670 --> 00:33.940
He's therefore unable to attend,

13
00:34.280 --> 00:34.940
so I'll be acting

14
00:35.520 --> 00:37.410
as your host in his place today.

15
00:38.110 --> 00:39.330
Spare us the pleasantries.

16
00:39.880 --> 00:40.980
Is the news your master sent

17
00:41.000 --> 00:42.130
with the Immortal Beacon true?

18
00:42.430 --> 00:43.300
Was Qi Fengyin

19
00:43.920 --> 00:45.650
really killed by Danshen's young disciple

20
00:45.750 --> 00:46.540
with a single sword thrust?

21
00:47.560 --> 00:48.300
There's no doubt.

22
00:48.960 --> 00:49.690
Yamao

23
00:50.110 --> 00:50.860
killed the devil herself

24
00:51.150 --> 00:52.580
in front of my master

25
00:53.030 --> 00:53.980
and all our fellow disciples.

26
00:54.520 --> 00:55.450
Everyone at Mount Zhaowu

27
00:55.960 --> 00:56.900
can bear witness.

28
00:58.180 --> 00:59.000
Wonderful!

29
00:59.000 --> 01:00.300
That herb spirit has so little power.

30
01:00.710 --> 01:01.820
How could she kill that devil?

31
01:02.520 --> 01:04.930
Qi Fengyin hadn't recovered from his injuries.

32
01:05.350 --> 01:06.540
He thought he had Yamao

33
01:06.840 --> 01:07.980
at his mercy,

34
01:08.640 --> 01:09.980
so he let his guard down.

35
01:10.400 --> 01:11.820
That gave her an opening.

36
01:12.920 --> 01:13.460
He had only

37
01:14.200 --> 01:15.260
his own arrogance to blame.

38
01:16.280 --> 01:17.570
We've been on guard day and night.

39
01:17.790 --> 01:18.540
Who would've thought

40
01:19.040 --> 01:19.690
Qi Fengyin

41
01:19.710 --> 01:20.930
would meet his end just like that?

42
01:20.950 --> 01:21.410
Indeed.

43
01:21.840 --> 01:23.620
Such an extraordinary feat has actually been achieved

44
01:24.400 --> 01:26.100
before the Saintess of the Tides has even awakened.

45
01:26.310 --> 01:26.900
This

46
01:26.950 --> 01:29.260
is a blessing for all beings in the Six Realms.

47
01:29.760 --> 01:31.050
The world is rid of the devil

48
01:31.400 --> 01:32.410
and restored to peace,

49
01:33.040 --> 01:35.380
all thanks to Yamao.

50
01:36.040 --> 01:36.820
Without her,

51
01:37.120 --> 01:38.410
no one could have taken him

52
01:38.430 --> 01:39.260
by surprise.

53
01:39.480 --> 01:40.020
In return,

54
01:42.760 --> 01:43.740
she has a great favor

55
01:44.350 --> 01:45.740
to ask of you, our esteemed sect leaders.

56
01:56.640 --> 01:59.050
Please, esteemed sect leaders, save my master.

57
02:22.060 --> 02:27.940
♪Winds rise. Youth fades. Joy and sorrow turn to nothing♪

58
02:29.980 --> 02:35.940
♪Blossoms fade away. This fleeting life is but a dream♪

59
02:36.980 --> 02:41.220
♪Desire blinds my eyes♪

60
02:44.900 --> 02:52.460
♪Our paths now part, and I cannot make you stay♪

61
02:52.820 --> 02:59.580
♪If love is deadly poison, hate is a furnace that sears the heart♪

62
03:00.820 --> 03:07.460
♪What is devotion? I fool my heart and spin my own cocoon♪

63
03:08.660 --> 03:15.500
♪Anger, obsession, greed, resentment, and envy bring trials across lifetimes♪

64
03:17.100 --> 03:23.620
♪The past turns to dust. I regret nothing, though my love was misplaced♪

65
03:28.380 --> 03:30.180
[Blossom in Darkness]

66
03:30.180 --> 03:32.180
[Based on the novel "Blossom in Darkness" by Guo Guo]

67
03:32.180 --> 03:35.180
[Episode 11]

68
03:35.400 --> 03:36.820
We have many guests staying here today.

69
03:37.310 --> 03:39.010
Please take extra care with the arrangements.

70
03:39.590 --> 03:40.410
Yes, Qingxing.

71
03:42.910 --> 03:43.850
So we're treating her

72
03:44.080 --> 03:45.730
as a guest of honor now?

73
03:48.590 --> 03:50.380
You mean Yamao?

74
03:51.590 --> 03:53.060
She rid the world of a menace.

75
03:53.200 --> 03:54.290
That's no small achievement.

76
03:54.690 --> 03:55.510
Of course

77
03:55.590 --> 03:56.640
she deserves every courtesy.

78
03:56.960 --> 03:57.870
How long is she staying?

79
03:58.710 --> 03:59.260
I'm not sure.

80
03:59.840 --> 04:00.340
But

81
04:00.710 --> 04:02.410
she's never liked Mount Zhaowu.

82
04:02.630 --> 04:03.570
I doubt she'll stay long.

83
04:04.400 --> 04:05.820
Once High Immortal Danshen is saved,

84
04:06.080 --> 04:06.890
she'll probably go back

85
04:06.910 --> 04:07.780
to Luoshen Valley with him.

86
04:08.150 --> 04:08.890
That's for the best.

87
04:09.430 --> 04:10.890
We don't need her

88
04:11.280 --> 04:12.610
causing more trouble here.

89
04:15.590 --> 04:16.980
You two really don't get along.

90
04:17.120 --> 04:18.430
Do you have a grudge against her?

91
04:20.480 --> 04:21.610
Why would I hold a grudge?

92
04:22.000 --> 04:23.170
When she was mixed up

93
04:23.190 --> 04:24.100
with that devil,

94
04:24.270 --> 04:25.610
of course I was hostile toward her.

95
04:26.390 --> 04:28.340
Now that she's cut ties with him,

96
04:29.270 --> 04:30.610
why would I have a problem with her?

97
04:33.120 --> 04:34.020
Still,

98
04:35.630 --> 04:36.610
she stayed by Qi Fengyin's side,

99
04:36.630 --> 04:37.540
biding her time for so long.

100
04:38.070 --> 04:39.810
She must be quite the schemer.

101
04:40.190 --> 04:40.930
You'd better

102
04:41.600 --> 04:42.850
keep your distance from her too.

103
04:55.800 --> 04:57.370
That wretched Yamao.

104
04:57.830 --> 04:58.730
She kept telling

105
04:58.750 --> 05:00.020
His Lordship to trust her,

106
05:00.390 --> 05:02.170
but she had it all planned from the start.

107
05:02.720 --> 05:04.290
I'll avenge His Lordship.

108
05:07.310 --> 05:08.050
Esteemed sect leaders,

109
05:08.430 --> 05:09.050
my master

110
05:09.310 --> 05:10.980
exhausted all his spiritual power

111
05:12.070 --> 05:12.850
defending the Saintess's Shrine

112
05:13.310 --> 05:14.370
during the firestorm

113
05:15.480 --> 05:16.460
and turned into this soul crystal.

114
05:17.360 --> 05:18.700
Now that Qi Fengyin is dead,

115
05:19.430 --> 05:20.460
for the sake of your bonds

116
05:20.920 --> 05:22.050
with my master,

117
05:22.390 --> 05:23.340
please save him.

118
05:24.120 --> 05:25.340
We can't afford any more delay.

119
05:27.270 --> 05:28.980
While trying to revive the Saintess of the Tides,

120
05:29.430 --> 05:30.730
we had our differences with you

121
05:31.040 --> 05:32.490
and neglected High Immortal Danshen.

122
05:33.000 --> 05:34.660
It was our fault.

123
05:35.240 --> 05:37.250
High Immortal Danshen is a man of integrity.

124
05:37.870 --> 05:39.780
He's given his all for the immortal sects.

125
05:40.630 --> 05:42.700
We'll do everything we can.

126
05:43.160 --> 05:44.250
But now,

127
05:44.310 --> 05:46.290
with only his spirit left in this world,

128
05:46.950 --> 05:48.580
how can we help you?

129
05:50.390 --> 05:51.460
My master said

130
05:53.360 --> 05:55.290
that Master Cang had a magical artifact

131
05:55.750 --> 05:56.490
brimming with spiritual power.

132
05:57.430 --> 05:58.050
Perhaps

133
05:59.120 --> 06:00.580
it could bring High Immortal Danshen back.

134
06:06.950 --> 06:07.730
What's with that look?

135
06:08.310 --> 06:09.850
Our sects stand together to fight evil and uphold justice.

136
06:10.070 --> 06:11.410
High Immortal Danshen and Mount Zhaowu

137
06:11.560 --> 06:12.220
have done

138
06:12.240 --> 06:13.020
all the work for us.

139
06:13.820 --> 06:15.140
Now you're even reluctant

140
06:15.270 --> 06:16.340
to lend out an artifact?

141
06:16.680 --> 06:18.490
I'm not reluctant.

142
06:19.600 --> 06:20.930
It's only an artifact.

143
06:21.160 --> 06:22.220
Do you think I can't spare it?

144
06:27.630 --> 06:29.050
This is Luoliang Immortal Sect's

145
06:29.070 --> 06:29.990
most powerful

146
06:29.990 --> 06:30.730
artifact:

147
06:31.950 --> 06:32.930
the Demon Soul Talisman.

148
06:54.240 --> 06:56.340
That talisman is mine.

149
07:01.920 --> 07:03.140
Since we have the artifact,

150
07:03.390 --> 07:04.370
let's not waste any time.

151
07:04.720 --> 07:06.250
Master Cang, please tell us

152
07:06.560 --> 07:08.610
how we can save High Immortal Danshen.

153
07:10.870 --> 07:11.410
It can't save him.

154
07:13.120 --> 07:13.900
Why not?

155
07:15.310 --> 07:16.140
If it could,

156
07:16.160 --> 07:17.370
I'd have brought it out long ago.

157
07:19.070 --> 07:20.290
Can't you see?

158
07:21.630 --> 07:22.700
This artifact

159
07:22.720 --> 07:24.170
was damaged in an incident.

160
07:24.680 --> 07:25.540
A corner's missing.

161
07:25.830 --> 07:26.580
It no longer has

162
07:26.600 --> 07:27.610
any spiritual power.

163
07:28.190 --> 07:28.930
Oh, no.

164
07:30.430 --> 07:31.290
If it's no longer useful,

165
07:32.000 --> 07:32.540
then Master...

166
07:33.510 --> 07:34.220
My master

167
07:34.720 --> 07:36.370
already knew about the Demon Soul Talisman

168
07:37.480 --> 07:38.610
and that it was damaged.

169
07:39.510 --> 07:40.580
He's taught me a way to repair it.

170
07:41.270 --> 07:42.460
If you all combine

171
07:42.560 --> 07:43.850
your spiritual power to reforge it,

172
07:44.360 --> 07:46.540
it can be fully restored.

173
07:49.560 --> 07:50.780
You have a way to repair it?

174
07:51.390 --> 07:52.340
Why didn't you say so sooner?

175
07:52.680 --> 07:53.700
If you'd known sooner,

176
07:53.830 --> 07:55.140
you'd have settled in here

177
07:55.310 --> 07:56.050
and refused to leave.

178
07:57.720 --> 07:59.220
The technique my master taught me

179
07:59.360 --> 08:00.020
takes seven days.

180
08:00.830 --> 08:01.540
During that time,

181
08:02.120 --> 08:03.250
I ask that you all

182
08:03.430 --> 08:04.780
remain here at Mount Zhaowu.

183
08:05.240 --> 08:06.250
I've already had

184
08:06.950 --> 08:08.100
guest rooms prepared for you.

185
08:25.800 --> 08:26.930
Let go of me!

186
08:27.070 --> 08:28.610
That thing belongs to me!

187
08:30.720 --> 08:32.250
Are you going to repay my kindness

188
08:32.250 --> 08:33.010
by killing me?

189
08:33.910 --> 08:35.420
I never should've used my herbs to save you.

190
08:36.000 --> 08:36.820
You've got it wrong.

191
08:36.960 --> 08:37.980
I'm not trying to kill you.

192
08:38.630 --> 08:39.460
I'm a demon.

193
08:39.630 --> 08:40.820
You sect lackeys and I

194
08:40.870 --> 08:41.610
are sworn enemies.

195
08:42.080 --> 08:42.730
Don't expect me

196
08:42.960 --> 08:43.580
to believe you!

197
08:45.840 --> 08:47.180
All the sect leaders are here today.

198
08:47.320 --> 08:48.000
It's far too dangerous

199
08:48.000 --> 08:48.940
for you to hide there.

200
08:49.480 --> 08:50.300
Any one of them

201
08:50.360 --> 08:51.180
could reduce you to ashes

202
08:51.270 --> 08:52.250
with a wave of their hand.

203
08:52.600 --> 08:54.010
That's why I got you out of there.

204
08:57.440 --> 08:58.340
Thank you for saving me

205
08:58.670 --> 09:00.220
from the miasma of desire in Peach Blossom Paradise.

206
09:00.790 --> 09:02.890
I've been meaning to thank you in person ever since.

207
09:18.080 --> 09:19.180
Looks like you have a conscience.

208
09:20.670 --> 09:21.460
Those were

209
09:21.480 --> 09:22.840
my lifesaving herbs.

210
09:23.200 --> 09:24.220
They're priceless.

211
09:25.790 --> 09:27.980
You owe me a debt of gratitude.

212
09:28.030 --> 09:28.770
Don't you ever forget it.

213
09:29.670 --> 09:30.820
Offer me three incense sticks

214
09:30.840 --> 09:31.580
morning and night.

215
09:33.360 --> 09:34.530
If I get the chance,

216
09:34.910 --> 09:35.610
I promise

217
09:36.080 --> 09:37.130
I'll repay you properly.

218
09:37.750 --> 09:38.490
But today,

219
09:38.600 --> 09:39.770
all the sects are gathered at Mount Zhaowu.

220
09:40.480 --> 09:41.730
If a little demon like you

221
09:41.870 --> 09:42.730
is discovered hiding here,

222
09:42.750 --> 09:43.940
you won't survive.

223
09:44.080 --> 09:44.680
So

224
09:44.840 --> 09:45.570
I must ask you

225
09:45.720 --> 09:46.850
to leave Mount Zhaowu at once.

226
09:48.270 --> 09:49.530
I'm no little demon!

227
09:53.320 --> 09:54.180
I'm a mighty demon!

228
09:55.670 --> 09:56.580
Don't look down on me.

229
09:56.910 --> 09:58.490
I'll go wherever I please

230
09:58.720 --> 09:59.420
on your wretched mountain!

231
10:10.910 --> 10:11.490
Hao.

232
10:13.840 --> 10:15.700
Thank you for your help today.

233
10:16.000 --> 10:16.980
Even if you hadn't asked,

234
10:17.150 --> 10:17.610
we'd still do

235
10:17.870 --> 10:19.180
all we could to save High Immortal Danshen.

236
10:21.750 --> 10:22.580
Everything that happened

237
10:23.510 --> 10:24.650
happened because of Qi Fengyin.

238
10:25.960 --> 10:27.220
I hope you won't hold it against us.

239
10:29.360 --> 10:30.250
I know it wasn't personal.

240
10:31.000 --> 10:32.460
As long as Master can be saved,

241
10:32.670 --> 10:34.250
a few setbacks don't matter.

242
10:36.360 --> 10:38.250
At least it's all settled now.

243
10:39.200 --> 10:40.100
But...

244
10:43.390 --> 10:44.180
something still baffles me.

245
10:45.120 --> 10:46.490
After that long talk we had,

246
10:47.030 --> 10:47.850
I thought

247
10:48.360 --> 10:49.940
you considered Qi Fengyin a friend.

248
10:50.120 --> 10:51.890
Why did you turn on him?

249
10:56.720 --> 10:58.820
Qi Fengyin used my master's life to blackmail me.

250
10:59.600 --> 11:00.980
I've wanted to kill him more than once.

251
11:01.390 --> 11:02.420
Back at Mount Leiguan,

252
11:02.910 --> 11:04.300
if he hadn't been lucky enough to escape,

253
11:05.030 --> 11:06.130
he never would've lived this long.

254
11:07.440 --> 11:08.130
Besides,

255
11:09.240 --> 11:10.250
isn't Qi Fengyin's death

256
11:10.750 --> 11:11.820
something to celebrate?

257
11:14.030 --> 11:15.820
Why do you sound almost sorry

258
11:16.150 --> 11:17.250
that he's dead, Hao?

259
11:17.480 --> 11:18.490
Do you think

260
11:18.630 --> 11:19.680
he didn't deserve to die?

261
11:19.750 --> 11:20.460
Of course not.

262
11:21.080 --> 11:22.340
Qi Fengyin is the source of all evil.

263
11:22.790 --> 11:23.730
Had he become the Devil Incarnate,

264
11:23.910 --> 11:24.850
he would've wreaked havoc on the world.

265
11:25.790 --> 11:26.730
You once thought

266
11:27.030 --> 11:28.130
someone else might have caused

267
11:28.270 --> 11:28.940
the firestorm in Luoshen Valley.

268
11:29.480 --> 11:31.060
I asked Master when I returned.

269
11:31.440 --> 11:33.890
He said only the Saintess of the Tides,

270
11:34.550 --> 11:35.580
if she were still alive,

271
11:35.910 --> 11:37.130
could match him in power.

272
11:39.030 --> 11:39.890
So

273
11:41.080 --> 11:42.100
the firestorm in Luoshen Valley

274
11:42.910 --> 11:43.980
could only have been Qi Fengyin's doing?

275
11:44.510 --> 11:45.060
That's right.

276
11:45.840 --> 11:46.650
So by killing him,

277
11:47.150 --> 11:47.770
you've done

278
11:48.440 --> 11:50.700
both your master and the world a tremendous service.

279
11:53.840 --> 11:54.980
Where has Uncle Du

280
11:55.000 --> 11:55.770
taken Duyao?

281
11:56.510 --> 11:57.370
Is she really

282
11:57.440 --> 11:58.940
one of his artifacts in human form?

283
11:59.960 --> 12:01.100
I've never seen Master use

284
12:01.200 --> 12:02.010
an artifact like that.

285
12:03.390 --> 12:04.060
But don't worry.

286
12:04.790 --> 12:06.460
He'd never harm an innocent person.

287
12:06.870 --> 12:08.340
She's safe at Mount Zhaowu.

288
12:09.240 --> 12:09.890
Just

289
12:10.200 --> 12:11.460
stay here and get some rest

290
12:11.750 --> 12:12.940
until High Immortal Danshen returns.

291
12:14.600 --> 12:15.490
Thank you, Hao.

292
12:17.030 --> 12:18.010
Oh, Hao,

293
12:18.670 --> 12:19.650
at the Zi hour tonight,

294
12:19.670 --> 12:20.730
come to the hill out back.

295
12:25.200 --> 12:25.890
Make sure you come.

296
13:12.840 --> 13:13.460
You're awake.

297
13:17.200 --> 13:17.910
Don't be afraid.

298
13:19.000 --> 13:19.850
I mean you no harm.

299
13:20.840 --> 13:21.890
You've been asleep for so long.

300
13:23.000 --> 13:24.940
It seems you haven't fully adjusted

301
13:25.600 --> 13:26.700
to this world yet.

302
13:27.150 --> 13:28.580
Am I really one of your artifacts in human form?

303
13:30.080 --> 13:30.820
Of course not.

304
13:33.150 --> 13:34.420
But I'm the only one in this world

305
13:35.600 --> 13:38.370
who knows who you really are.

306
13:38.790 --> 13:39.610
Who am I, really?

307
13:40.790 --> 13:41.700
And why did I

308
13:42.000 --> 13:43.770
find Qi Fengyin so familiar?

309
13:44.440 --> 13:45.060
In a few days,

310
13:45.790 --> 13:46.530
I'll need your help

311
13:47.080 --> 13:48.300
with something very important.

312
13:49.150 --> 13:49.820
If you agree to help,

313
13:50.670 --> 13:53.060
I'll tell you who you really are

314
13:53.750 --> 13:54.980
when the time comes.

315
13:56.670 --> 13:57.850
What do I need to do?

316
13:59.000 --> 14:00.100
When the time is right,

317
14:00.630 --> 14:01.650
I'll tell you.

318
14:10.910 --> 14:11.850
Let this golden seal bind our pact.

319
14:12.150 --> 14:13.300
When I need you,

320
14:13.750 --> 14:14.820
you will answer my summons

321
14:15.390 --> 14:16.490
and come to my aid.

322
14:20.030 --> 14:20.460
All right.

323
14:25.550 --> 14:26.850
If you hadn't happened

324
14:27.480 --> 14:28.940
to awaken outside the shrine,

325
14:29.390 --> 14:31.250
you'd never have forgotten who you are,

326
14:32.150 --> 14:33.580
and I never would've been able

327
14:33.600 --> 14:35.380
to use your power to fulfill my life's goal,

328
14:36.120 --> 14:37.320
Saintess of the Tides.

329
14:46.360 --> 14:47.610
Die, you vile woman!

330
14:48.610 --> 14:48.940
Youyou!

331
14:49.480 --> 14:50.420
Are you crazy? What are you doing?

332
14:50.440 --> 14:51.840
How dare you ask me that?

333
14:51.870 --> 14:53.120
You liar!

334
14:53.240 --> 14:54.850
What a despicable thing to do!

335
14:54.960 --> 14:56.890
I couldn't stop you from wanting His Lordship dead.

336
14:57.080 --> 14:58.090
And you can hate evil

337
14:58.320 --> 14:59.220
all you like.

338
14:59.390 --> 15:00.580
But how could you trick him

339
15:00.870 --> 15:02.310
and kill him after winning his trust?

340
15:02.670 --> 15:03.740
Today, I'll avenge His Lordship

341
15:04.120 --> 15:05.700
and see justice done!

342
15:06.630 --> 15:07.180
Oh, no!

343
15:07.630 --> 15:08.890
Stay right there! Listen to me!

344
15:09.910 --> 15:10.340
I...

345
15:11.080 --> 15:12.180
I had no choice.

346
15:12.750 --> 15:13.980
I had to save my master.

347
15:14.360 --> 15:15.460
What else could I do?

348
15:15.790 --> 15:17.060
What else could you do?

349
15:17.170 --> 15:18.580
Did you even look for another way?

350
15:18.750 --> 15:19.460
No excuse could justify

351
15:19.630 --> 15:20.820
your deceiving and killing him!

352
15:20.960 --> 15:22.270
His Lordship even gave you

353
15:22.270 --> 15:22.970
your soul crystal back!

354
15:23.120 --> 15:24.480
He trusted you completely.

355
15:24.670 --> 15:25.180
And you?

356
15:25.360 --> 15:26.380
You repaid him

357
15:26.380 --> 15:27.410
with heartless betrayal!

358
15:27.720 --> 15:28.730
Die!

359
15:30.870 --> 15:32.070
Stop acting crazy and listen to me!

360
15:32.250 --> 15:33.610
- He was evil! He... - I'll kill you,

361
15:33.630 --> 15:34.730
you evil wretch!

362
15:36.240 --> 15:37.100
What are you talking about?

363
15:38.750 --> 15:39.610
You're just in time.

364
15:40.120 --> 15:40.610
I was saying

365
15:40.790 --> 15:41.770
she's selfish

366
15:41.910 --> 15:42.820
and wicked.

367
15:42.910 --> 15:43.980
To win the immortal sects' protection,

368
15:44.000 --> 15:44.890
she killed

369
15:44.890 --> 15:46.250
your Big Brother Qi Fengyin herself!

370
15:47.960 --> 15:48.820
He's dead?

371
15:51.270 --> 15:52.250
- Duyao! - Duyao!

372
15:55.960 --> 15:56.580
Duyao,

373
15:57.150 --> 15:58.100
listen to me.

374
15:58.870 --> 15:59.490
Qi Fengyin

375
15:59.720 --> 16:01.100
was a fearsome devil,

376
16:01.630 --> 16:02.100
a terrible villain.

377
16:02.510 --> 16:04.300
So many people in the immortal sects wanted him dead.

378
16:04.510 --> 16:05.700
If he were still alive,

379
16:06.240 --> 16:07.490
how much longer would we have to

380
16:07.490 --> 16:08.300
keep running and hiding?

381
16:09.480 --> 16:10.220
Besides,

382
16:10.630 --> 16:12.250
you've only met him a few times.

383
16:13.320 --> 16:14.650
There's no need to be so upset.

384
16:20.550 --> 16:21.180
Bah!

385
16:21.550 --> 16:22.980
If you hadn't stabbed him in the back,

386
16:23.240 --> 16:24.220
His Lordship would still be alive!

387
16:25.360 --> 16:26.580
You're with the immortal sects, all right.

388
16:27.270 --> 16:28.580
You're a coldhearted hypocrite!

389
16:29.270 --> 16:30.300
Even Duyao,

390
16:30.320 --> 16:31.460
who only met His Lordship once,

391
16:31.720 --> 16:32.820
is heartbroken.

392
16:33.240 --> 16:34.180
Compared to her,

393
16:34.440 --> 16:35.540
you're not even human!

394
16:36.240 --> 16:37.060
Of course I'm not human!

395
16:38.200 --> 16:39.370
I'm just a medicinal herb.

396
16:39.790 --> 16:40.300
You should

397
16:40.840 --> 16:41.700
leave Mount Zhaowu at once.

398
16:42.080 --> 16:42.820
If anyone finds you,

399
16:42.820 --> 16:43.570
I can't save you.

400
16:44.960 --> 16:45.700
I've had enough!

401
16:45.960 --> 16:47.010
Today, I'll make you

402
16:47.030 --> 16:47.940
join His Lordship in death!

403
16:53.480 --> 16:54.010
Stay right there!

404
16:54.480 --> 16:55.100
Stop crying!

405
16:59.080 --> 16:59.650
I can't take this anymore.

406
17:00.320 --> 17:01.100
Come with me.

407
17:34.270 --> 17:35.860
Can't they just find me

408
17:36.880 --> 17:39.380
some kitchen helpers who know what they're doing?

409
17:48.480 --> 17:49.770
What are you trying to do?

410
17:50.200 --> 17:51.090
I'm warning you.

411
17:51.110 --> 17:52.310
I've wised up.

412
17:52.310 --> 17:52.970
You won't fool me again.

413
18:07.510 --> 18:08.090
Big Brother!

414
18:10.240 --> 18:10.730
Let me see.

415
18:20.440 --> 18:20.940
My Lord!

416
18:21.330 --> 18:21.940
Big Brother!

417
18:23.310 --> 18:23.980
Big Brother!

418
18:24.270 --> 18:24.820
My Lord!

419
18:25.160 --> 18:25.900
- Big Brother! - My Lord!

420
18:27.440 --> 18:28.360
Calm down, both of you.

421
18:28.440 --> 18:29.140
My disguise spell

422
18:29.160 --> 18:30.330
only affects what people see.

423
18:30.550 --> 18:31.660
It can't stop them from hearing you.

424
18:31.920 --> 18:32.620
If someone finds us out,

425
18:32.680 --> 18:33.460
we're all done for.

426
18:37.720 --> 18:39.090
Honored cultivators,

427
18:39.310 --> 18:40.530
what are you looking for here?

428
18:41.070 --> 18:41.810
We...

429
18:45.550 --> 18:46.290
Well...

430
18:54.480 --> 18:56.090
Our sect leader is unwell

431
18:56.270 --> 18:57.250
and needs

432
18:57.270 --> 18:58.250
special medicinal dishes,

433
18:58.790 --> 19:00.770
but we're not very familiar with Mount Zhaowu,

434
19:01.000 --> 19:01.490
so, madam,

435
19:02.550 --> 19:04.900
could we borrow one of your helpers?

436
19:13.480 --> 19:14.140
Come on, hurry.

437
19:25.070 --> 19:25.760
I knew

438
19:25.760 --> 19:26.840
Yamao could never have

439
19:26.840 --> 19:27.570
killed you, My Lord.

440
19:27.960 --> 19:28.380
Be honest.

441
19:28.830 --> 19:29.750
What really happened?

442
19:30.110 --> 19:31.410
It was all an act, of course.

443
19:31.920 --> 19:33.330
Had Qi Fengyin not faked his death,

444
19:33.790 --> 19:34.770
I wouldn't have dared to come to Mount Zhaowu,

445
19:35.310 --> 19:36.490
and I'd have no hope of saving Master.

446
19:37.000 --> 19:38.290
You two planned it all beforehand?

447
19:43.000 --> 19:44.810
What did Yamao offer His Lordship

448
19:45.350 --> 19:47.120
to make him play along with her?

449
19:50.790 --> 19:52.010
How do you plan to make it up to me?

450
19:57.270 --> 19:58.140
After all you've done,

451
19:58.590 --> 20:00.860
I'll do anything you ask, Lord Qi.

452
20:04.350 --> 20:05.770
A poisonous herb like you is no use to me.

453
20:09.480 --> 20:10.940
Big Brother, if you're staying here,

454
20:11.550 --> 20:13.180
what do we do if they find out who you are?

455
20:13.960 --> 20:14.490
Right now,

456
20:14.510 --> 20:15.770
all the sects believe Qi Fengyin is dead.

457
20:16.160 --> 20:17.140
This is when they're

458
20:17.140 --> 20:18.020
least on guard.

459
20:21.680 --> 20:23.250
Have you found a way to save your master?

460
20:24.440 --> 20:25.140
In seven days,

461
20:25.590 --> 20:26.860
once the sects repair the Demon Soul Talisman,

462
20:27.240 --> 20:28.290
I can use it to save my master.

463
20:28.590 --> 20:30.090
That talisman is so powerful

464
20:30.240 --> 20:30.940
because it was

465
20:30.960 --> 20:32.180
mine to begin with.

466
20:32.440 --> 20:34.010
It was formed from my demonic core.

467
20:35.830 --> 20:37.290
I'm not exaggerating this time.

468
20:37.350 --> 20:38.380
I'm telling the truth.

469
20:39.030 --> 20:39.770
When you're done with it,

470
20:39.790 --> 20:40.730
remember to give it back to me.

471
20:44.790 --> 20:45.180
All right.

472
20:45.960 --> 20:47.460
Until the talisman is repaired,

473
20:48.270 --> 20:49.010
we all

474
20:49.030 --> 20:49.980
need to keep a low profile.

475
20:51.550 --> 20:52.700
None of us can afford to slip up.

476
20:57.680 --> 20:59.010
Why are you looking at me?

477
20:59.110 --> 21:00.530
You should be worried about her.

478
21:00.830 --> 21:01.860
She's with Du Zhong.

479
21:01.960 --> 21:03.140
And she clearly

480
21:03.140 --> 21:04.420
hasn't seen much of the world.

481
21:04.480 --> 21:05.250
She'd be easy to fool.

482
21:05.790 --> 21:06.770
I won't be fooled.

483
21:07.550 --> 21:09.010
I'm on your side.

484
21:20.070 --> 21:20.570
What's wrong?

485
21:21.440 --> 21:22.260
You don't want to go back?

486
21:27.750 --> 21:29.050
You asked me to fake my death to help you.

487
21:30.070 --> 21:30.730
But you never said

488
21:30.750 --> 21:31.900
I'd have to disguise myself like this.

489
21:32.750 --> 21:33.860
In that miserable kitchen,

490
21:34.880 --> 21:35.530
Yeniang

491
21:35.550 --> 21:36.860
keeps making me work.

492
21:37.960 --> 21:39.940
She even made me chop that foul stuff.

493
21:41.070 --> 21:42.050
You mean the onions?

494
21:42.510 --> 21:43.770
Now I stink of them.

495
21:45.030 --> 21:45.730
Disgusting.

496
21:47.240 --> 21:49.090
No wonder you kept washing your hands.

497
21:49.960 --> 21:50.620
I'm not going back.

498
21:55.480 --> 21:57.480
I got these sweets from some disciples

499
21:57.480 --> 21:58.250
of Luoliang Immortal Sect.

500
21:58.550 --> 21:58.960
Have one.

501
22:03.270 --> 22:04.310
There may not be many,

502
22:04.510 --> 22:05.140
but they're worth a fortune.

503
22:06.310 --> 22:07.470
You can have them all.

504
22:08.110 --> 22:09.050
Is that enough to make it up to you?

505
22:13.480 --> 22:13.860
No.

506
22:20.000 --> 22:20.530
I know

507
22:20.550 --> 22:21.770
it's been hard for you

508
22:22.270 --> 22:23.280
to stay at Mount Zhaowu

509
22:23.350 --> 22:24.420
and play along with me.

510
22:25.350 --> 22:26.250
Since you arrived here,

511
22:26.480 --> 22:27.530
has the Wanjun Lock been affecting you?

512
22:33.510 --> 22:34.660
This place is rich in spiritual power,

513
22:35.240 --> 22:36.860
making it much easier for the lock to suppress me.

514
22:37.310 --> 22:38.010
If this keeps up,

515
22:38.030 --> 22:38.530
the lock

516
22:38.550 --> 22:39.530
will soon overpower you.

517
22:40.350 --> 22:41.630
Why don't you wait for me down the mountain?

518
22:42.160 --> 22:43.770
The immortal sects are at peace now.

519
22:44.030 --> 22:44.820
I'll be fine.

520
22:45.240 --> 22:45.770
But if anyone

521
22:45.960 --> 22:47.450
finds out who you are,

522
22:47.960 --> 22:48.860
you'll be in serious trouble.

523
22:49.240 --> 22:51.140
I doubt it's as peaceful here as you think.

524
22:51.920 --> 22:53.050
Since I arrived at Mount Zhaowu,

525
22:53.830 --> 22:55.220
I've sensed a strange aura here.

526
22:55.720 --> 22:56.730
I'd worry if I

527
22:57.960 --> 22:58.660
left you here alone.

528
23:26.960 --> 23:27.700
It hurts so much.

529
23:29.510 --> 23:30.660
I died a horrible death.

530
23:35.960 --> 23:37.140
Someone, please save me!

531
23:39.960 --> 23:40.420
Changpu!

532
23:44.030 --> 23:45.090
Someone, please save me!

533
24:11.640 --> 24:12.180
Changpu?

534
24:22.160 --> 24:22.700
Yeniang?

535
24:27.240 --> 24:29.810
Another nightmare, Master Du?

536
24:33.480 --> 24:36.090
Have a bowl of my Soul-Soothing Porridge.

537
24:40.830 --> 24:41.250
Here,

538
24:41.510 --> 24:42.090
Master Du.

539
24:59.030 --> 25:00.180
Hao, over here!

540
25:06.680 --> 25:07.180
Yamao,

541
25:07.920 --> 25:09.770
what couldn't you tell me during the day

542
25:10.640 --> 25:12.050
that had to be said out here at night?

543
25:14.830 --> 25:15.570
Sit down first.

544
25:26.270 --> 25:27.570
I know this seems strange,

545
25:27.880 --> 25:29.660
but it can only be done at night.

546
26:11.640 --> 26:12.220
Is this...?

547
26:13.070 --> 26:14.620
Moonlit Revival Herbs in full bloom.

548
26:29.750 --> 26:30.320
Master,

549
26:31.070 --> 26:32.560
I did as you told me

550
26:32.560 --> 26:33.530
and kept it out of the light.

551
26:34.160 --> 26:35.460
Why did this Moonlit Revival Herb

552
26:35.460 --> 26:36.730
still die?

553
26:36.960 --> 26:38.140
I've already told you

554
26:39.000 --> 26:40.820
this herb can't be grown by human hands.

555
26:41.960 --> 26:43.700
Why are you still so obsessed with it?

556
26:44.680 --> 26:46.050
I'm not obsessed.

557
26:46.240 --> 26:48.420
I just remembered you said

558
26:48.960 --> 26:50.250
that once fully grown,

559
26:50.550 --> 26:52.010
this herb could merge with the moonlight

560
26:52.550 --> 26:54.980
and shine wherever it pleased.

561
26:56.000 --> 26:58.090
I was just a little curious to see it.

562
26:58.510 --> 27:00.530
Only a little. I'm not obsessed.

563
27:02.110 --> 27:03.330
If you weren't obsessed, you'd be at ease.

564
27:04.200 --> 27:06.290
Why keep repeating that you aren't?

565
27:15.510 --> 27:16.660
Uncle Du once mentioned

566
27:16.680 --> 27:17.770
in a chat with my master

567
27:18.200 --> 27:19.380
that you took such pains to grow it

568
27:20.110 --> 27:21.090
because you wanted to see

569
27:21.110 --> 27:22.410
a Moonlit Revival Herb in full bloom.

570
27:24.640 --> 27:25.490
Thank you, Yamao.

571
27:27.510 --> 27:28.730
I should be thanking you.

572
27:30.160 --> 27:31.980
You came down the mountain to save me,

573
27:32.310 --> 27:34.250
and now you're helping repair the talisman.

574
27:35.030 --> 27:36.460
You even defied your master's orders

575
27:36.590 --> 27:37.410
and were punished for it.

576
27:38.000 --> 27:40.050
You've done so much for me along the way.

577
27:41.550 --> 27:42.250
You give me too much credit.

578
27:43.400 --> 27:44.220
As immortal sect disciples,

579
27:45.160 --> 27:46.380
of course we should help each other.

580
27:47.440 --> 27:48.420
As for defying my master's orders,

581
27:50.590 --> 27:51.660
it wasn't entirely because of you.

582
27:54.750 --> 27:56.460
But I did benefit from your help.

583
27:57.160 --> 27:58.490
My master taught me

584
27:58.720 --> 28:01.540
to repay kindness many times over.

585
28:02.400 --> 28:04.090
But as Mount Zhaowu's chief disciple,

586
28:04.090 --> 28:04.880
you have everything you need.

587
28:05.070 --> 28:06.520
I don't have anything of value

588
28:06.520 --> 28:07.250
to thank you with.

589
28:07.640 --> 28:09.670
So I thought of this instead.

590
28:44.790 --> 28:45.620
Consider this display

591
28:46.030 --> 28:47.800
of silver blossoms my gift.

592
28:48.310 --> 28:49.660
May your path to immortality

593
28:49.920 --> 28:51.050
be as bright as these blossoms

594
28:51.310 --> 28:52.290
and free of all obstacles.

595
29:01.790 --> 29:02.900
And I wish you

596
29:03.750 --> 29:04.570
peace and good fortune.

597
29:05.590 --> 29:06.900
I'm sure I'll have both.

598
29:07.590 --> 29:08.460
In seven days,

599
29:08.480 --> 29:09.380
once Master is back,

600
29:09.790 --> 29:11.410
who in the world would dare hurt me?

601
29:12.720 --> 29:13.380
Then

602
29:14.030 --> 29:15.600
we'll go to Luoliang Immortal City

603
29:15.830 --> 29:17.140
and wait for the Wish Tree to appear.

604
29:22.750 --> 29:23.330
You...

605
29:25.790 --> 29:28.220
want to marry High Immortal Danshen?

606
29:31.160 --> 29:33.180
Let's hope nothing else goes wrong

607
29:33.920 --> 29:35.620
and it all turns out just as you wished.

608
30:33.400 --> 30:34.330
Qi Fengyin?

609
30:36.920 --> 30:38.000
Why did you come over

610
30:38.000 --> 30:38.770
without letting me know?

611
30:39.000 --> 30:39.980
You startled me.

612
30:44.270 --> 30:44.860
What's wrong?

613
30:46.000 --> 30:46.980
I helped you too.

614
30:48.640 --> 30:49.900
Why did only Yuwen Hao

615
30:49.920 --> 30:51.050
get to see the Moonlit Revival Herbs?

616
30:52.270 --> 30:53.290
You were there?

617
30:56.350 --> 30:57.140
Qi Fengyin,

618
30:57.920 --> 30:59.250
you could be exposed at any moment.

619
30:59.680 --> 31:00.940
You shouldn't be wandering around.

620
31:01.000 --> 31:01.840
If Yuwen Hao

621
31:01.840 --> 31:02.970
had seen you just now,

622
31:03.200 --> 31:04.180
everything we'd worked for

623
31:04.200 --> 31:04.850
would've been for nothing.

624
31:04.850 --> 31:06.140
You didn't answer my question.

625
31:07.510 --> 31:08.530
Why did I only get

626
31:08.550 --> 31:10.730
a bag of sweets someone else gave you,

627
31:11.070 --> 31:12.390
while you went to all this trouble

628
31:12.390 --> 31:13.700
for Yuwen Hao,

629
31:14.350 --> 31:15.980
even expending your spiritual power?

630
31:17.550 --> 31:19.010
You're being ridiculous.

631
31:20.070 --> 31:21.180
If you don't like

632
31:21.200 --> 31:21.900
those sweets,

633
31:22.030 --> 31:23.050
you can give them back to me.

634
31:23.270 --> 31:24.700
Stop twisting my words.

635
31:25.030 --> 31:25.770
Then what's your point?

636
31:32.720 --> 31:33.700
You made it clear that you

637
31:33.720 --> 31:34.700
didn't like my true form.

638
31:38.070 --> 31:39.130
When did I ever say that?

639
31:39.440 --> 31:40.590
At Mount Leiguan.

640
31:41.960 --> 31:43.770
You even said my medicinal scent stank.

641
31:45.550 --> 31:46.550
That's because you were

642
31:46.550 --> 31:47.230
being annoying.

643
31:47.350 --> 31:48.620
I was being annoying?

644
31:53.200 --> 31:54.360
You're just unhappy

645
31:54.360 --> 31:55.230
with life at Mount Zhaowu,

646
31:55.480 --> 31:56.570
so you're picking a fight with me.

647
31:58.160 --> 31:58.810
When I was suffering

648
31:58.830 --> 32:00.180
from your dark energy because of your flower,

649
32:00.550 --> 32:01.770
did I ever lash out at you?

650
32:03.160 --> 32:04.420
Why should I have to answer to you

651
32:05.160 --> 32:06.490
just for meeting Yuwen Hao?

652
32:07.270 --> 32:07.900
Who you see

653
32:07.920 --> 32:08.860
has nothing to do with me.

654
32:09.640 --> 32:10.810
But as long as you carry the mystical flower,

655
32:11.110 --> 32:13.250
whether you live or die concerns me.

656
32:15.680 --> 32:16.730
I told you there's something

657
32:17.110 --> 32:18.490
very strange about Mount Zhaowu.

658
32:19.030 --> 32:20.250
The one who shouldn't be wandering around

659
32:20.350 --> 32:20.940
is you.

660
32:21.680 --> 32:23.010
You don't own me.

661
32:24.110 --> 32:24.980
We're only stuck together

662
32:25.000 --> 32:26.000
because we need each other.

663
32:26.160 --> 32:26.960
What gives you the right

664
32:26.960 --> 32:27.840
to meddle in my affairs?

665
32:30.880 --> 32:32.460
And if I insist on meddling?

666
32:54.400 --> 32:55.140
Sorry.

667
32:55.640 --> 32:56.940
I've come at a bad time.

668
32:57.110 --> 32:58.300
I'll leave you two alone.

669
32:58.480 --> 32:58.980
No need.

670
33:17.750 --> 33:18.900
Why did His Lordship leave?

671
33:23.720 --> 33:25.530
Wait, you two were arguing?

672
33:27.270 --> 33:28.660
Who knows what's gotten into him?

673
33:32.480 --> 33:33.290
Perfect. I'm hungry.

674
33:35.640 --> 33:38.220
The cooks at Mount Zhaowu

675
33:38.350 --> 33:39.290
are terrible!

676
33:39.680 --> 33:40.450
Why are these pastries

677
33:40.450 --> 33:41.770
so lopsided?

678
33:44.350 --> 33:45.860
Did Qi Fengyin make these?

679
33:47.400 --> 33:49.380
Did he come to bring me pastries?

680
33:50.400 --> 33:51.810
Was what I said just now

681
33:52.310 --> 33:53.900
a little too harsh?

682
34:11.320 --> 34:12.420
Of course I don't care who she sees.

683
34:20.400 --> 34:22.090
But she does have a point.

684
34:25.110 --> 34:26.210
Is it really

685
34:27.110 --> 34:28.690
because I think I own her

686
34:30.510 --> 34:32.420
that I won't let anyone near her

687
34:34.030 --> 34:35.610
and don't like her getting close to others?

688
34:45.150 --> 34:45.780
Malice?

689
35:15.590 --> 35:16.440
Master's coming out of seclusion!

690
35:16.880 --> 35:17.690
- Let's go. - Come on.

691
35:27.710 --> 35:28.820
I never should've gone soft

692
35:28.880 --> 35:30.300
and eaten Qi Fengyin's pastries.

693
35:31.400 --> 35:33.090
If I'd known they were this lethal,

694
35:33.440 --> 35:34.170
I'd have used them

695
35:34.190 --> 35:35.340
to defend myself.

696
35:41.070 --> 35:42.610
Today, the sect leaders

697
35:42.610 --> 35:43.860
will be repairing the talisman.

698
35:44.880 --> 35:45.860
It's a happy occasion.

699
35:46.880 --> 35:47.900
I've got to perk up.

700
35:58.550 --> 35:59.610
Come on. We don't want to be late.

701
36:19.670 --> 36:21.130
Welcome back

702
36:21.280 --> 36:22.820
from seclusion, Master!

703
36:26.840 --> 36:27.780
I've gathered you all

704
36:28.230 --> 36:29.340
to make an important announcement.

705
36:30.190 --> 36:31.860
While healing in seclusion,

706
36:32.360 --> 36:33.380
I gained insight into the way of Heaven.

707
36:34.190 --> 36:35.940
I will soon ascend to immortality.

708
36:37.220 --> 36:37.690
Ascension?

709
36:37.710 --> 36:38.490
Ascending to immortality?

710
36:40.590 --> 36:41.490
I thought

711
36:41.800 --> 36:42.420
ascension

712
36:42.760 --> 36:44.420
could only happen in ancient legends.

713
36:44.800 --> 36:45.610
I never imagined

714
36:45.710 --> 36:46.570
I'd see it with my own eyes.

715
36:46.800 --> 36:47.570
Throughout history,

716
36:47.760 --> 36:49.570
countless people have sought immortality.

717
36:50.030 --> 36:51.210
But only the Saintess of the Tides

718
36:51.630 --> 36:52.820
has ever ascended to godhood.

719
36:54.360 --> 36:55.650
Master has now glimpsed the way of Heaven

720
36:56.070 --> 36:57.380
and done what no ordinary person could.

721
36:57.920 --> 36:58.820
Mount Zhaowu truly is

722
36:59.190 --> 37:00.340
the foremost among the immortal sects.

723
37:01.280 --> 37:02.790
- That's right. - Yes.

724
37:03.000 --> 37:04.120
- The leading sect! - The leading sect!

725
37:07.590 --> 37:08.420
Now that I've attained enlightenment,

726
37:08.670 --> 37:09.570
once I ascend,

727
37:10.070 --> 37:11.210
I'll choose a place

728
37:11.280 --> 37:12.170
to live in seclusion.

729
37:13.280 --> 37:14.650
Now that the Devil Incarnate has been slain,

730
37:15.190 --> 37:16.820
I have no interest in worldly affairs.

731
37:18.030 --> 37:20.210
Nor am I suited to any position

732
37:20.480 --> 37:21.570
among the immortal sects.

733
37:24.550 --> 37:25.380
As of today,

734
37:26.480 --> 37:29.460
the leadership of Mount Zhaowu will pass

735
37:30.280 --> 37:30.940
to my chief disciple,

736
37:31.760 --> 37:32.300
Yuwen Hao.

737
37:34.920 --> 37:35.780
He deserves it!

738
37:46.320 --> 37:46.780
Master,

739
37:47.320 --> 37:48.740
ascending to godhood

740
37:49.360 --> 37:50.380
won't change the path you follow.

741
37:50.920 --> 37:52.380
Why are you leaving Mount Zhaowu?

742
37:53.110 --> 37:53.900
With my limited cultivation,

743
37:54.710 --> 37:55.530
I fear I'm not ready yet.

744
37:56.360 --> 37:57.420
Please reconsider, Master.

745
37:59.230 --> 37:59.980
That's right, Master.

746
38:00.360 --> 38:01.210
Hao

747
38:01.440 --> 38:02.690
may be Mount Zhaowu's chief disciple

748
38:02.920 --> 38:03.650
and, by rights,

749
38:03.840 --> 38:05.460
the natural choice to succeed you.

750
38:05.840 --> 38:07.050
But he has repeatedly

751
38:07.550 --> 38:09.130
defied your orders and betrayed the sect.

752
38:09.670 --> 38:10.780
Even after being sent to Wuchang Prison,

753
38:11.070 --> 38:12.740
he showed no remorse for what he'd done.

754
38:13.480 --> 38:14.570
So I agree

755
38:15.110 --> 38:17.260
that he's unfit to be sect leader.

756
38:20.060 --> 38:21.170
Who else is there but Hao?

757
38:21.320 --> 38:23.380
What do you mean, Zhiwei?

758
38:23.960 --> 38:25.050
Hao is far stronger

759
38:25.110 --> 38:26.650
than any other disciple in this sect.

760
38:27.000 --> 38:28.740
What happened before was all a misunderstanding.

761
38:29.710 --> 38:30.980
Now that the Devil Incarnate is dead,

762
38:31.400 --> 38:32.780
why bring up the past?

763
38:33.400 --> 38:34.980
If Hao isn't up to the task,

764
38:35.960 --> 38:37.490
do you think you are?

765
38:37.840 --> 38:38.820
Is that how you speak to your senior?

766
38:38.920 --> 38:39.490
And is that how

767
38:39.510 --> 38:40.570
you speak to Senior Brother Yuwen?

768
38:42.550 --> 38:43.130
Enough.

769
38:46.150 --> 38:47.610
I'm still here.

770
38:48.110 --> 38:49.980
Is this how you should behave?

771
38:51.070 --> 38:51.940
We were wrong, Master.

772
38:52.920 --> 38:53.460
Since

773
38:54.360 --> 38:55.530
there are still doubts

774
38:55.670 --> 38:57.170
about my successor as sect leader,

775
38:57.710 --> 38:59.090
I'll follow our sect's rules

776
38:59.590 --> 39:01.740
and set a succession trial.

777
39:02.670 --> 39:03.650
Whoever wins

778
39:04.760 --> 39:05.980
will be the one to succeed me

779
39:06.000 --> 39:06.690
as sect leader.

780
39:07.710 --> 39:09.010
I wish to take part, Master.

781
39:21.000 --> 39:22.090
I'm willing to try, Master.

782
39:29.360 --> 39:30.380
This is a Bodhi Fruit.

783
39:30.840 --> 39:31.460
Yuwen Hao,

784
39:31.630 --> 39:32.050
Zhiwei,

785
39:32.630 --> 39:34.050
you will each take a fruit and nurture it

786
39:34.320 --> 39:35.420
with your cultivation techniques.

787
39:35.960 --> 39:36.530
Whichever of you

788
39:36.840 --> 39:38.490
makes it sprout first

789
39:39.280 --> 39:41.010
will be the next sect leader.

790
39:42.670 --> 39:43.090
But Master,

791
39:44.190 --> 39:45.090
it's hollow.

792
39:45.510 --> 39:46.380
How can I make it sprout?

793
39:47.000 --> 39:48.090
"Enlightenment is no tree,

794
39:48.400 --> 39:49.530
nor is the mind a mirror on a stand."

795
39:50.150 --> 39:51.010
All things in this world

796
39:51.280 --> 39:52.690
are nothing but emptiness.

797
39:53.590 --> 39:55.380
If you keep your mind clear and free of obsession

798
39:55.920 --> 39:57.220
and let all things pass through it

799
39:57.220 --> 39:58.090
without leaving a trace,

800
39:58.800 --> 40:00.010
that shows true faith in the immortal path.

801
40:00.840 --> 40:01.780
With the path in your heart,

802
40:02.190 --> 40:04.090
why should a Hollow Bodhi Fruit trouble you?

803
40:09.110 --> 40:10.570
I never thought someone in the immortal sects

804
40:11.440 --> 40:13.090
could actually ascend.

805
40:14.110 --> 40:14.980
Good thing this happened

806
40:15.000 --> 40:16.460
after our time in Peach Blossom Paradise.

807
40:29.280 --> 40:30.490
What were you doing there?

808
40:30.800 --> 40:31.570
None of your business.

809
40:32.110 --> 40:32.340
You...

810
40:32.840 --> 40:34.010
You're still angry?

811
40:37.960 --> 40:38.820
I'll chalk last night up

812
40:38.840 --> 40:40.050
to you needing to blow off some steam.

813
40:40.510 --> 40:41.380
I'll be the bigger person

814
40:41.380 --> 40:42.300
and let it slide.

815
40:43.150 --> 40:44.350
I even ate your pastries

816
40:44.350 --> 40:45.420
and had a stomachache all night.

817
40:47.400 --> 40:48.740
Let's call it even.

818
40:49.480 --> 40:50.380
Why would those pastries

819
40:50.400 --> 40:51.380
give you a stomachache?

820
40:51.550 --> 40:52.530
Don't get me started.

821
40:54.960 --> 40:56.050
Why did you come to the main hall?

822
40:59.070 --> 41:00.130
I saw a wisp of malice.

823
41:00.550 --> 41:01.010
What?

824
41:03.800 --> 41:04.900
This is Mount Zhaowu.

825
41:05.110 --> 41:06.010
The whole mountain is full

826
41:06.070 --> 41:07.570
of disciples who ward off evil.

827
41:07.670 --> 41:08.780
How could there be any malice here?

828
41:12.110 --> 41:14.380
Is the spiritual power here so strong

829
41:15.150 --> 41:16.490
that it's throwing off your senses?

830
41:17.510 --> 41:18.170
Believe it or don't.

831
41:18.360 --> 41:19.330
All right.

832
41:19.360 --> 41:19.980
I believe you.

833
41:20.070 --> 41:21.300
I believe you, all right?

834
41:21.960 --> 41:23.530
I saw a wisp of malice last night.

835
41:24.510 --> 41:26.380
But the spiritual power here is so strong

836
41:26.920 --> 41:27.900
that I lost its trail.

837
41:28.110 --> 41:28.820
The Five Great Sects

838
41:29.150 --> 41:30.340
are all gathered at Mount Zhaowu.

839
41:31.150 --> 41:32.130
It is possible

840
41:32.150 --> 41:33.090
some people with ill intent

841
41:33.590 --> 41:34.650
have slipped in among them.

842
41:34.960 --> 41:36.460
No wonder you kept saying there was something

843
41:36.880 --> 41:38.130
very strange about Mount Zhaowu.

844
41:39.630 --> 41:40.300
Don't worry.

845
41:40.710 --> 41:41.280
I'll help you

846
41:41.280 --> 41:42.460
find that wisp of malice.

847
41:43.030 --> 41:43.650
But this disguise spell

848
41:44.590 --> 41:45.780
I cast with medicinal powder

849
41:46.190 --> 41:47.530
is only a simple trick.

850
41:48.190 --> 41:49.460
If anyone gets suspicious,

851
41:49.630 --> 41:50.940
they can easily break it.

852
41:51.320 --> 41:52.090
Remember,

853
41:52.320 --> 41:53.610
don't go parading around

854
41:53.630 --> 41:54.300
where the disciples

855
41:54.320 --> 41:55.530
can see you.

856
41:56.400 --> 41:58.010
I'm still stronger than the Wanjun Lock.

857
41:58.760 --> 42:00.210
Unless I choose to reveal myself,

858
42:00.630 --> 42:02.050
no one can find me.

859
42:03.840 --> 42:04.740
Hey, new guy.

860
42:05.960 --> 42:07.400
Get back to work in the kitchen.

861
42:07.440 --> 42:08.860
Stop slacking off here.

862
42:13.840 --> 42:14.570
Hurry up.

863
42:39.870 --> 42:40.490
Qi Fengyin!

864
42:40.880 --> 42:41.610
This is...

865
42:42.000 --> 42:43.300
The depths of Du Zhong's dream?

866
42:43.630 --> 42:45.260
I can't believe I failed to catch her.

867
42:45.550 --> 42:46.780
Why does every path I take

868
42:47.030 --> 42:48.090
lead me right back here?

869
42:48.360 --> 42:49.690
Is there even a way out?

870
43:13.620 --> 43:17.660
♪See this world where flowers have yet to bloom♪

871
43:17.900 --> 43:21.340
♪So many longings♪

872
43:22.020 --> 43:24.100
♪Linger in the web of fate♪

873
43:24.300 --> 43:29.300
♪Then vanish like mist in a moment♪

874
43:30.220 --> 43:34.260
♪Before seas turn to fields♪

875
43:34.500 --> 43:37.940
♪Dreams scatter across the sky♪

876
43:38.620 --> 43:40.700
♪One look into each other's eyes♪

877
43:40.900 --> 43:48.300
♪And we fall in love in an instant♪

878
43:49.700 --> 43:53.380
♪When a hundred thousand blossoms have withered♪

879
43:53.620 --> 43:57.300
♪I'll still want to stay with you like this forever♪

880
43:57.940 --> 44:01.500
♪The wish we made in the long night♪

881
44:01.820 --> 44:05.980
♪Still waits to come true♪

882
44:06.220 --> 44:09.900
♪However many hardships this vast world holds♪

883
44:10.460 --> 44:14.100
♪I'll stay by your side♪

884
44:14.580 --> 44:18.180
♪Love will grace our days till the end of time♪

885
44:18.420 --> 44:25.740
♪When the dream ends, we'll have no regrets♪

886
44:39.220 --> 44:43.260
♪Before seas turn to fields♪

887
44:43.500 --> 44:46.940
♪Dreams scatter across the sky♪

888
44:47.620 --> 44:49.700
♪One look into each other's eyes♪

889
44:49.860 --> 44:57.300
♪And we fall in love in an instant♪

890
44:58.220 --> 45:01.900
♪However many hardships this vast world holds♪

891
45:02.500 --> 45:06.100
♪I'll stay by your side♪

892
45:06.620 --> 45:10.180
♪Love will grace our days till the end of time♪

893
45:10.420 --> 45:17.740
♪When the dream ends, we'll have no regrets♪
